   "open": [
    "Which fibroblast source and which donor/passage.",
    "Serum level during and after washout, which changes latent TGF-beta supply and adsorption.",
    "Substrate stiffness, which the pack shows can determine contractility on its own.",
    "The exact day after washout at which persistence is scored."
